# Arathi Highlands (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, manuals and formulas whose
# SOURCE is physically in Arathi Highlands for a Horde buyer, verified
# against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop
# tables). Nine are vendor-sold by in-zone Horde vendors (Keena and Tunkk
# at Hammerfall, Jun'ha nearby, George Candarte at Stromgarde — every buy
# carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor); seven are mob drops with
# narrow in-zone droppers. Recipes sold only by Alliance vendors do not
# ship (the Raptor Hide Belt is a genuine Horde gap — its sole vendor is
# Alliance). Everything else Arathi-dropping is a generic multi-zone world
# drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory); quest records carry
# no reward data, so none of that class ships (see
# docs/arathi-horde-companions-inventory.md and docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no Arathi Horde source, so that is
# stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-horde-recipes
title Arathi Highlands (Horde) - Recipes
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords arathi, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Hammerfall (Keena)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Keena (74.09, 32.73) at Hammerfall sells both recipes; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 3682 "Recipe: Curiously Tasty Omelet" npc 2821
  buy 12228 "Recipe: Roast Raptor" npc 2821
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Leatherworking — Hammerfall (Keena)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Keena (74.09, 32.73) at Hammerfall sells the pattern; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 5973 "Pattern: Barbaric Leggings" npc 2821
  note Hammon Karwn in Refuge Pointe stocks this pattern as well, but his shop is Alliance — Horde characters buy here. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Enchanting — Hammerfall (Keena)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Enchanting 1

  tip Keena (74.09, 32.73) at Hammerfall sells the formula; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 11163 "Formula: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Deflection" npc 2821
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Leatherworking — Hammerfall (Tunkk)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Tunkk (74.84, 34.59) at Hammerfall sells the pattern; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 13287 "Pattern: Raptor Hide Harness" npc 2819
  note Tunkk is the sole vendor anywhere in the data for this pattern. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Tailoring — Hammerfall (Jun'ha)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Jun'ha (72.69, 36.45) at Hammerfall sells all three patterns; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 7089 "Pattern: Azure Silk Cloak" npc 6574
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag" npc 6574
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag" npc 6574
  note The reagent-bag patterns are sold by dozens of vendors worldwide, but Jun'ha sells them here. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Tailoring — Stromgarde (George Candarte)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip George Candarte (28.1, 11.8) at Stromgarde sells the pattern; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 7613 "Pattern: Green Leather Armor" npc 2698
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

