  collect 249487 "Formula: Twisted Nether Wand" optional
  note Dropped only by the Boulderfist Magus (level 36); the formula drops nowhere else in the data.

step Blacksmithing — the northwest (rare drop)

  zone map 1417

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 19,20
  collect 251335 "Plans: Sterling Silver Boots" optional
  note Dropped only by the Syndicate Watchman (level 20) — BELOW the core band (30-40), so trivial at Horde levels; sweep it opportunistically. The plans drop nowhere else in the data.

