step First Aid — no Arathi Horde source

  note The data holds no First Aid recipe sold by a Horde vendor or dropped in Arathi Highlands: Deneb Walker in Refuge Pointe is Alliance-only. Polestar's own profession guides cover that profession's progression.

step Fishing — no Arathi source

  note The data holds no Fishing recipe sourced in Arathi Highlands: no in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. Polestar's own profession guides cover that profession's progression.
